  doc: https://shardsui.com/svelte/combobox
---

<ComponentPreview name="p-combobox-1" />

## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/combobox.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as Combobox from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/combobox";
</script>

<Combobox.Root {items}>
  <Combobox.Input placeholder="Select an item..." />
  <Combobox.Popup>
    <Combobox.Empty>No results found.</Combobox.Empty>
    <Combobox.List>
      <Combobox.Collection>
        {#snippet children(item)}
          <Combobox.Item value={item}>{item.label}</Combobox.Item>
        {/snippet}
      </Combobox.Collection>
    </Combobox.List>
  </Combobox.Popup>
</Combobox.Root>
```

## API Reference

### Combobox.Root

Manages single or multiple selection, input state, filtering, and popup state.

### Combobox.Input

The input used for single selection.

### Combobox.Popup

The positioned options popup.

### Combobox.List

A scrollable options container.

### Combobox.Item

An individual selectable option.

### Combobox.Empty

Shown when no options match.

### Combobox.Group

Groups related options.

### Combobox.GroupLabel

Labels an option group.

### Combobox.Collection

Renders filtered options through a typed snippet.

### Combobox.Chips

Contains selected chips in multiple mode.

### Combobox.ChipsInput

The input used inside `Combobox.Chips`.

### Combobox.Chip

A selected value in multiple mode.

### Combobox.Value

Provides the current value to a typed snippet.

